OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face level crossing waits
OL,4,A'up to 20 minutes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns about the length of time level
OL,7,Fcrossing barriers block traffic for
OL,8,Fhave been raised a year on from safety
OL,9,Fworks at the sites.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail reconstructed multiple
OL,12,Flevel crossings on multiple lines in
OL,13,FSurrey in 2025 as part of projects
OL,14,Faimed at improving safety.
OL,16,FCouncillor Bob Hughes, who represents
OL,17,FShere ward, said residents did not
OL,18,Fexpect the "enormous increase in the
OL,19,Fwaiting time", which he said could be
OL,20,F"up to 20 minutes".
OL,22,FNetwork Rail was contacted for comment.
